    "# LESSON 8.4. COLAB FORWARD-LOOKING APPLICATION: PacBio (SMRT/HiFi) Pipeline Execution\n",
    "# FOOTNOTE: this cell is set aside as a guide for when you find independent PacBio raw data in your own work later.\n",
    "# (Since our current project is hybrid, the ONT file trimmed in the previous step is bridged in as the\n",
    "# input file here for simulation purposes.)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"--- PART 2: PacBio (PACBIO SMRT/HiFi) WORKFLOW ---\")\n",
    "print(\"Running the PacBio raw data directly through Filtlong's length and quality filter...\\n\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# PacBio Architecture Parameters: quality preservation is high (95%), minimum length threshold is strict (2000 bases).\n",
    "!filtlong --min_length 2000 --keep_percent 95 filtered_reads/trimmed_ONT.fastq > filtered_reads/filtered_PacBio_simulation.fastq\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\nExcellent! The filtering strategy for the PacBio scenario has been completed in a separate cell.\")\n",
